  {
    id: 'uab3-03',
    batteryId: 'battery-10',
    batteryTitle: 'UAB Set 3: Family, Media & Festivals',
    title: "Commercial breaks",
    domain: 'Media & Advertising',
    difficulty: 'B2',
    rawText: `Love them or hate them, commercial breaks are a fact of life when it comes to TV. They are a real pain in the neck when they interrupt your favourite show to bombard you with information on the latest gadgets or greasy snacks. But, surprising as it may sound, ads do have their upsides. Commercials themselves can be highly entertaining and often offer a welcome change of pace if you are watching something lengthy. They can also give you just enough time to grab a drink or go to the toilet. So, don't be too hard on ads the next time you feel like moaning about them.`,
  },
  {
